        "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head></head><body>\n<p>This is a very important chapter. Here we got knowledge about a new chemical class of carbonyl compounds. In this chapter, we study important name reactions like aldol condensation, Cannizzaro reaction, Haloform reaction, Tollen's test, etc. They are very important reactions of organic chemistry and also direct questions arise from these reactions. They have vast applications in various fields like acetone is used as solvent in many reactions. A very good amount of questions arise from this chapter in various examinations.</p>\n</body></html>",
